   "title": "Sum and difference",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&|z_1+z_2|^{2}=(x_1+x_2)^{2}+(y_1+y_2)^{2}\\\\[5pt]&|z_1-z_2|^{2}=(x_1-x_2)^{2}+(y_1-y_2)^{2}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
